<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Saigon Guide: 13 places – District 1, Nguyễn Huệ, Cholon &amp; Cu Chi – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. District 1</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Set off in the early morning – from noon it is hot and the lanes are crowded. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>106.69963,10.77539,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Nguyễn Huệ at night</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come at sunset and stay until dark – then the promenade glows. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>106.70405,10.77372,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Ben Thanh Market</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the morning when it is cooler and less crowded, and eat a noodle soup there. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>106.69804,10.77253,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. War Remnants Museum</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come early in the morning or later in the afternoon and plan a quiet break afterwards. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>106.69228,10.77936,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Notre-Dame Cathedral &amp; Central Post Office</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Write a postcard at the post office – stamps are cheap, and the hall is nicer than the square outside. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>106.69999,10.77996,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Reunification Palace (Independence Palace)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Get an audio guide and go to the basement bunker first. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>106.69549,10.77703,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Bitexco Financial Tower &amp; Saigon Skydeck</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come 30–45 minutes before sunset and stay until dusk. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>106.70446,10.77186,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Jade Emperor Pagoda (Chùa Ngọc Hoàng)</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the morning when fewer tour groups are there, and dress appropriately. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>106.69769,10.79153,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Cholon – Chinatown, Thien Hau Temple &amp; Binh Tay Market</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Go in the morning and eat at a small local place – the cuisine here has Chinese roots. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>106.65897,10.75182,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Vĩnh Khánh – seafood street (District 4)</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Go by Grab, order several small portions and ask about the price. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>106.70464,10.76086,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. Cu Chi Tunnels</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Bring water and mosquito repellent and plan half a day. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/saigon/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>106.52912,11.06304,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
